        "Name": "V3 Robotic Lawn Mower with GPS Assisted Navigation (Up to 1_SLASH_8 acre)",
        "ModelNumbers": [
          "SKRMV3"
        ],
        "Description": "EFFORTLESS ONE-TOUCH START: In just 3 minutes, your Sunseeker V3 begins mowing, giving you more time to enjoy your lawn and less time fiddling with complicated installations ViSION VI: Equipped with the ViSION VI dual-eye system, the V3 recognizes over 160+ obstacles in 3D, allowing it to navigate your yard intelligently and safely ADAPTS TO COMPLEX TERRAIN & PRECISE EDGE CUTTING: The V3 easily handles 22° steep slopes and complex terrain, using Vision AI to cut clean edges along paths, and has an 8-inch cutting width and adjustable height (1.57-3.2 inches) for a neat, even lawn PET-FRIENDLY DESIGN WITH LOW NOISE: Operating at an ultra-quiet 55dB, it's safe and comfortable for pets—perfect for peaceful mowing in the early morning or late evening. MULTI-ZONE NAVIGATION & BOUNDARY MANAGEMENT: Navigate multiple garden zones with ease using magnetic tags and strips, enabling seamless transitions and reliable virtual boundaries for complete lawn coverage. AUTO RECHARGE & RAIN DETECTION SYSTEM: Automatically returns to charge or pause in rain, with IPX5 waterproofing for durability, easy cleaning, and reliable all-weather performance. SMART APP CONTROL & OTA UPGRADES: Easily schedule, adjust, and monitor mowing through the intuitive app, with Over-the-Air upgrades keeping your mower always up-to-date for a fully automated, personalized lawn care experience. CUSTOMER LOCAL SUPPORT: Get peace of mind with dedicated EU based support, offering expert advice, troubleshooting, and assistance whenever you need it.",
